From 6a23d2c58fc6ceaca9827f9eafc845d537e54533 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mini <mini@local>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:37:36 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Bundle the Dracula theme with VS Code colors and
 workbench tokens

Consolidates the bundled Dracula theme (with VS Code Dracula colors for
the editor, panels, activity bar, floating cards, connected tabs, and
scrollbars) alongside the extra theme color tokens it defines.
